   "text": "Canadian University Dubai - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nCanadian University Dubai\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nCanadian University Dubai (CUD) offers undergraduate and graduate degree programs based on a world-leading international curriculum. Located in the city’s vibrant business district, CUD gives students the unique opportunity to obtain a first-class Canadian education while experiencing the dynamic lifestyle of Dubai, United Arab Emirates.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 08:55\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 08:55\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Arab Emirates\nYearly Fees\nMax: AED 103,719.00\nMin: AED 69,646.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n25%\n500 of 2,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n2006\nCampus(es)\nDubai\nCountry\nUnited Arab Emirates\nExcluded Countries\nUnited Arab Emirates\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n17/07/2025\nContract End Date\n21/01/2028\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.cud.ac.ae/life-on-campus/accommodation\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.cud.ac.ae/scholarships\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/c/CanadianUniversityDubai\nInternship Details\nhttps://www.cud.ac.ae/community-outreach/internships\nAdditional Information\n-",
